#: ../../user_manual/oncanvas_brush_editor.rst:31
msgid ""
"These set-ups are *per* brush engine, so different :ref:"
"`category_brush_engines` can have different configurations."
msgstr ""
"Ces configurations sont disponibles par moteur de brosses. Ainsi, "
"différentes :ref:`categories_moteurs_brosses`peuvent avoir différentes "
"configurations."

